export default function Page(){return <><JsonLd data={breadcrumb([{name:"Home",path:"/"},{name:"BMI Calculator",path:"/bmi-calculator"}])}/><section className="container py-14 text-center"><p className="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-700">Adult screening tool</p><h1 className="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">BMI Calculator</h1><p className="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-600">Get a real-time Body Mass Index result, category, and height-adjusted healthy-weight range. Designed for adults 18 and over.</p></section><section className="container"><Calculator/></section><Section title="Understanding your result"><Definition>Adult BMI is a screening measure—not a diagnosis. Health professionals interpret it alongside waist size, blood pressure, health history, fitness, and other factors.</Definition><div className="prose-health max-w-3xl"><h2>What happens after you calculate?</h2><p>Your result card explains where your BMI sits on the standard adult scale and shows the weight range corresponding to a BMI of 18.5–24.9 at your height. It is designed to prompt informed, supportive next steps, not to prescribe a treatment.</p><h2>Medical note</h2><p>Adult BMI categories do not apply to children or adolescents. BMI may be less representative during pregnancy, in competitive athletes, and in people with unusually high muscle mass. Seek individual advice for unexplained weight change or health concerns.</p></div></Section></>}
